        "explosion_math": "All three templates use default_grenade and these static power values are damage inputs, not guaranteed HP damage. The proc calls at charge_level 1; explosion parser resolves close_radius=0 because the templates omit close_radius. min_radius is the charge interpolation lower bound, not an inner damage radius; common explosion_radius_modifier multiplies radius. For falloff variants, code adjusts hit distance by breed.explosion_radius, computes x=(adjusted_distance-close_radius)/(radius-close_radius), then clamps x^2 to [0,1]. Cover raycast remains active. README/example uses 1-(1-0.14)^5 = 52.95729824%, rounded to 52.96%.",
